        "body": "XPENG INC. is a for-profit public company headquartered in Guangzhou, trading under the ticker XPEV and SEC CIK 0001810997, with an alias of XPENG INC - ADR. Its Spanish website, xpeng-auto.es, presents the brand under the tagline \"Xpande tu mundo\" and describes a 100% electric range.\n\nThe site says the company has been, since 2014, turning what the world calls the future into reality. It lists three models, the G6, G9, and P7+, as combining artificial intelligence, advanced driver assistance systems, and the SEPA 2.0 800-volt electric platform. The site states this platform allows charging from 10% to 80% in 12 minutes across the range, and that all three models carry the DGT CERO label and a warranty of up to 7 years / 160,000 km. The site also includes financing offers for the G6 and G9 through Open Bank, S.A., with CAETANO AUTOMOTIVE ESPAÑA DISTRIBUCIÓN, S.L.U. named as the data controller.",
